# KERNEL PANIC's pictures, built into kpanic_art.c by spr2c at build time.
#
# Bitmap sprites are 16x16 pattern-RAM slots at 4 bits a pixel: '.' is transparent
# and a hex digit is a palette slot (default palette: 1 red, 2 green, 4 blue, 6 cyan,
# 8 grey, 9 bright red, A bright green, B bright yellow, C bright blue, D bright
# magenta, E bright cyan, F white). Glyphs are soft-font characters, 1 bit a pixel:
# '#' is ink, drawn in the cell's attribute colours.
#
# Converted from GameSupply's space asset packs (gamesupply.itch.io), used under
# their licence. Some slots are not here but derived at start-up -- the flash
# pictures and every spread volley. See art_load() in kpanic.c.

# the craft, your trace process
@sprite art_craft 16x16
................
........4.......
.......CC.......
.......664......
......422C......
......6226C.....
.....46222C.....
.....C22226.....
....4622222C....
....4222222C....
...C62222226....
...C2266662AC...
...6A6C..46A6...
..C6C......C6C..
..CC........CC..
..4...........4.

